# Neighborhood Guardian: "Whenever another creature you control with power 2 or less enters, target creature you control gets
# +1/+1 until end of turn" (CR 603.2, 115.1, 611.2a). Bot1 casts the Guardian on turn 1 (Mox Pearl and Mox Jet): its own entering
# triggers nothing. Bot2's Memnite on turn 2 triggers nothing ("you control"). Bot1's Memnite on turn 3 triggers it: Bot2's Memnite
# is refused as the target (not Bot1's), Bot1 chooses the Guardian itself, which becomes 3/3 (both halves checked, the Memnite
# still 1/1). On turn 4 the Guardian is 2/2 again.

